From 3a8424f47140719b82317cae09033f69f0d7a523 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 22:31:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Bluebook-style UI polish
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- globals.css: Add image-frame utility classes (.img-frame, .img-frame-choice,
  .img-frame-review, .img-frame-passage) for consistent image framing with
  rounded corners, subtle borders, and object-fit: contain across all exam views

- page.tsx: Full landing page redesign — sticky nav bar, centered hero with
  SVG icon, clean test list with count, polished footer

- student layout: Fix stale bluebook-* class names → design tokens; polish
  sticky header with accent badge for Student label

- StudentDashboardClient: Fix all stale bluebook-* classes; add welcome card
  with avg score stat, polished test cards grid, attempts table with hover states

- StudentNav: Fix stale bluebook-* classes → design tokens

- ExamShell: Upgrade question card to rounded-xl; question number uses
  uppercase tracking label; sidebar heading uses uppercase tracking style

- QuestionDisplay: Add horizontal divider between stem and choices;
  passage panel takes 48% width on desktop; stem images use .img-frame

- AnswerChoices: Cleaner eliminate button (struck-through A vs Undo);
  images use .img-frame-choice; selected row has shadow-sm

- PassagePanel: Passage image uses .img-frame-passage; highlights tray
  styled with highlight/10 bg and pencil icon

- SectionBreak: SVG icons (checkmark / badge); rounded-2xl card with
  shadow-modal; full-width CTA button

- ResultsSummary: Score hero with colour-coded 5xl number and score bar;
  per-module mini progress bars; rounded-xl card with header band

- ResultsContent: Top action bar with back link + PDF download side by side

- AnswerReviewList: Correct/wrong icon circles; two-column answer summary
  cards (your answer / correct answer); choices list with colour-coded rows;
  explanation panel in accent-subtle; chevron rotates on expand
